<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <%- include('head') %>
  <body>
    <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: auto;">
      <%- include('header') %>

      <div class="flex" style="width: 100%; min-height: calc(100vh - 154px);">
        <div class="<%= isMobile ? 'page-container-m' : 'page-container' %> about-page">

          <div class="md-container">
            <div class="flex" style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              <div style="width: 50%;">
                <img
                  src="<%= prefix %>self.jpg"
                  style="width: 80%; height: auto; margin: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;"
                >

                <div>
                  <a href="https://github.com/Karshilov" class="about-link">GitHub</a>
                  /
                  <a href="mailto:karshilov@foxmail.com" class="about-link">Email</a>
                  /
                  <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=wJ8qrbwAAAAJ&hl=en" class="about-link">Google Scholar</a>
                  /
                  <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0002-6353-3659" class="about-link">ORCID</a>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div style="width: 50%;">
                <h4 style="margin-top: 0px;">Youyuan Liu</h4>

                <p>
                  Youyuan Liu is a third-year Ph.D. student at Temple University,
                  advised by
                  <a href="https://www.sianjin.com/" class="about-link">Dr. Sian Jin</a>.
                  His research focuses on high-performance computing, with a particular
                  interest in lossy compression for scientific data. His work has appeared
                  at leading conferences, including HPDC, ICS, VLDB, and SC.
                </p>

                <p>
                  He is also a long-term visiting student at Argonne National Laboratory,
                  working on compression and scheduling under the supervision of
                  <a href="https://www.anl.gov/profile/robert-underwood" class="about-link">Dr. Robert Underwood</a>.
                </p>

                <h4>Academic Service</h4>
                <p>
                  Reviewer:
                  Journal of Parallel and Distributed Computing (JPDC), 2026;
                  IEEE Transactions on Parallel and Distributed Systems (TPDS), 2026.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <%- include('footer') %>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>